################################################################################
# TICKET APPROVAL WORKFLOW
# Applies when ServiceItem.requires_approval = true
# Ticket starts as "pending_approval"; must be approved before work begins
################################################################################

### 67. Approve Ticket (manager or admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/11/approve/
Authorization: Token {{managerToken}}

### 68. Reject Ticket (manager or admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/11/reject/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Token {{managerToken}}

{
  "reason": "Budget not approved for this quarter. Please resubmit in Q3."
}

### 69. Approve another pending_approval ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/19/approve/
Authorization: Token {{managerToken}}

################################################################################
# TICKET STATUS TRANSITIONS (Technician / Section Head)
################################################################################

### 70. Assign Ticket (admin/manager/head_of_section)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/6/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Token {{adminToken}}

{
  "assigned_to": 12,
  "status": "assigned"
}

### 71. Start Work: Assigned → In Progress
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/2/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Token {{technicianToken}}

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 72. Put On Hold: In Progress → Pending
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Token {{technicianToken}}

{
  "status": "pending",
  "pending_reason": "awaiting_parts",
  "pending_comment": "Waiting for replacement NIC to arrive from supplier."
}

### 73. Resume Work: Pending → In Progress
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/3/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Token {{technicianToken}}

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 74. Resolve Ticket: In Progress → Resolved
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Token {{technicianToken}}

{
  "status": "resolved"
}

### 75. Close Ticket via dedicated close endpoint (admin/manager/HOD)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/9/close/
Authorization: Token {{adminToken}}

